WEBVTT

00:09:30.036 --> 00:09:31.676
Two years ago, a columnist wrote

00:09:31.716 --> 00:09:34.436
that the city smells so nice
now in the summer.

00:09:34.476 --> 00:09:37.076
The reasons are reduced traffic

00:09:37.076 --> 00:09:42.316
and the dramatic rise in proportion
of electric cars and buses.

00:09:42.836 --> 00:09:47.636
Sometimes technology development
exceeds our expectations.

00:09:47.996 --> 00:09:51.876
Ten years ago, few would have forecast
the numbers we see today:

00:09:52.356 --> 00:09:55.756
82 percent of all new passenger cars

00:09:55.756 --> 00:09:58.316
and 36 percent of new vans

00:09:58.316 --> 00:10:03.516
have so far in 2022 been zero-emission.